hjem-meny. "}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1523243685537697", "locale": "pt_PT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Blumhouse Forest", "keywords": [], "long_description": "O cen\u00e1rio \"Blumhouse Forest\" \u00e9 uma op\u00e7\u00e3o de ambiente no menu P\u00e1gina inicial imersiva do SO do Horizon que os utilizadores podem descarregar e para o qual podem mudar. O cen\u00e1rio apresenta uma noite inquietante numa floresta sombria em semelhan\u00e7a \u00e0 propriedade intelectual Blumhouse.", "short_description": "Op\u00e7\u00e3o de cen\u00e1rio no menu P\u00e1gina inicial imersiva do SO do Horizon. "}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1366889735133955", "locale": "fi_FI", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Blumhouse Forest", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u201dBlumhouse Forest\u201d -maisema on Horizon-k\u00e4ytt\u00f6j\u00e4rjestelm\u00e4n immersiivisen kodin valikon ymp\u00e4rist\u00f6vaihtoehto, jonka k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4t voivat ladata ja johon he voivat siirty\u00e4. Ymp\u00e4rist\u00f6 sijoittuu Blumhousen immateriaaliomaisuuteen perustuvaan synkk\u00e4\u00e4n mets\u00e4\u00e4n aavemaisena iltana.", "short_description": "Horizon-k\u00e4ytt\u00f6j\u00e4rjestelm\u00e4n immersiivisen kodin valikon maisemavaihtoehto. "}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1350285660055359", "locale": "zh_TW", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Blumhouse \u68ee\u6797", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u300cBlumhouse \u68ee\u6797\u300d\u4f48\u666f\u662f Horizon \u4f5c\u696d\u7cfb\u7d71\u6c89\u6d78\u5f0f\u5927\u5ef3\u529f\u80fd\u8868\u4e2d\u7684\u4e00\u500b\u4f48\u666f\u4e3b\u984c\u9078\u9805\uff0c\u7528\u6236\u53ef\u4e0b\u8f09\u5f8c\u5207\u63db\u4f7f\u7528\u3002\u6b64\u4f48\u666f\u4e3b\u984c\u4ee5 Blumhouse \u4f5c\u54c1\u4e2d\u7684\u9ed1\u6697\u68ee\u6797\u70ba\u4e3b\u984c\uff0c\u6642\u9593\u8a2d